{"id":"n66947-1-9","stage":1,"title":"뒤쪽 · 后面","scene":"察觉有人跟随","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66947-1-9-1","ko":"왜 아까부터 자꾸 뒤쪽을 쳐다봐?","zh":"为什么从刚才开始一直往后面看？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"아까부터","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까부터","audio":"/audio/ce21fb59ded82e3bd3d0.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤쪽을","meaning":"后面，后头，后部","explanation":"뒤쪽：后面，后头，后部；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뒤쪽","audio":"/audio/464ac5d0424e6b596506.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66947","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤쪽을","audio":"/audio/97a2043ea3155c8d6d31.mp3"}},{"text":"쳐다봐?","meaning":"朝后看、盯着看","explanation":"쳐다보다：盯着某个方向看；这里的目标是 뒤쪽“后面”，不表示一定抬头。","readings":[{"term":"쳐다보다","audio":"/audio/88b36c86329350da113a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72122","senseId":"2","lemma":"쳐다보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쳐다봐","audio":"/audio/04bb174d4407e0890e8b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","